  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waya wafika eDerbe laseListra. Kwakukhona lapho umfundi othiwa nguTimothi, indodana yowesifazana ongumJuda okholwayo, kodwa uyise wayengumGriki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wayenconywa ngabazalwane baseListra laseIkoniyuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UPawuli wathanda ukuba uTimothi ahambe laye; ngakho wamthatha, wamsoka ngenxa yabaJuda ababekhona kulezondawo; ngoba bonke babemazi ukuthi uyise ungumGriki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi bedabula imizi, babanika izigqibo ezagqitshwa ngabaphostoli labadala eJerusalema ukuba bazilondoloze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke amabandla aqiniswa ekukholweni, anda ngobunengi insuku ngensuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebedabula ilizwe laseFrigiya lelaseGalathiya, balelwa nguMoya oNgcwele ukukhuluma ilizwi eAsiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sebefikile maqondana leMisiya, balinga ukuya eBithiniya, kodwa uMoya kaJesu kabavumelanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho bayiceza iMisiya, behlela eTrowasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwabonakala kuPawuli umbono ebusuku; indoda yaseMakedoniya yayimi imncenga isithi: Welela eMakedoniya, usisize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esewubonile umbono, safuna masinyane ukuwelela eMakedoniya, sisithi uNkulunkulu usibizele ukutshumayela ivangeli kibo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho sasuka eTrowasi ngomkolo, saqonda eSamotrake, ngosuku olulandelayo saya eNeyapholi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasuka lapho saya eFiliphi, umuzi omkhulu wesigaba saseMakedoniya; lapho kwakuhlala amabutho amaRoma. Kulowomuzi sahlala insuku ezithile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngosuku lweSabatha saphumela ngaphandle kwesango lomuzi ngasemfuleni, lapho esasisithi kulendawo yokukhuleka khona; sahlala phansi, sakhuluma labesifazana ababebuthene lapho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owesifazana othile othiwa nguLidiya, ongumthengisi wamalembu ayibubende, owemzini othiwa yiTiyathira, okhonza uNkulunkulu, wasizwa, iNkosi yavula inhliziyo yakhe ukuba alalele okwakhulunywa nguPawuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuthe esebhaphathiziwe kanye lendlu yakhe, wasincenga esithi: Uba lingibona ukuthi ngithembekile eNkosini, wozani endlini yami lihlale khona. Wasicindezela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi sisiya endaweni yokukhuleka, sahlangana lentombazana eyisigqili elomoya wokuhlahluba, eyayizuzela abaniniyo inzuzo enengi ngokuvumisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yona yamlandela uPawuli lathi, isithi: Lababantu bazinceku zikaNkulunkulu oPhezukonke ezisitshumayeza indlela yokusiliswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lokhu yakwenza insuku ezinengi. Kwathi uPawuli esenengiwe waphenduka, wathi kumoya: Ngiyakulaya ngebizo likaJesu Kristu, phuma kuyo. Wahle waphuma ngalesosikhathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaniniyo sebebonile ukuthi ithemba lenzuzo yabo liphelile, babamba uPawuli loSilasi, babadonsela emdangeni bababeka phambi kwababusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sebebalethile enduneni, bathi: Lababantu bengabaJuda badunga umuzi wethu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bafundisa imikhuba esingavunyelwa ukuyamukela, siyenze thina esingamaRoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lexuku labelekelela, lenduna zabadabulela ingubo zabo, zalaya ukuba batshaywe ngenduku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sebebatshayile imivimvinya eminengi, babaphosa entolongweni, balaya umlindintolongo ukuba abalondoloze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena elayiwe ngokunjalo wabafaka entolongweni ephakathi, wabophela inyawo zabo ezigodweni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa phakathi kobusuku uPawuli loSilasi babekhuleka bedumisa uNkulunkulu ngamahubo, lezibotshwa zazibalalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi masinyane kwaba khona ukuzamazama okukhulu, kwaze kwanyikinyeka izisekelo zentolongo; kwavuleka masinyane iminyango yonke, kwathukuluka lezibopho zabo bonke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi umlindintolongo ephaphama, wabona iminyango yentolongo ivulekile; wakhokha umhedla wakhe efuna ukuzibulala, ngoba esithi izibotshwa zibalekile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uPawuli wamemeza ngelizwi elikhulu, wathi: Ungazilimazi, ngoba sikhona sonke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebiza ukuba kulethwe izibane, wagijimela phakathi ethuthumela ngokwesaba, wawela phansi phambi kukaPawuli loSilasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebakhuphela phandle, wathi: Madoda, ngenzeni ukuze ngisiliswe na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bona bathi kuye: Kholwa eNkosini uJesu, uzakusiliswa wena lendlu yakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebemtshumayeza ilizwi leNkosi, yena labo bonke ababesendlini yakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabathatha ngalesosikhathi sobusuku, wagezisa amanxeba abo, wabhaphathizwa khona lapho labo bonke abendlu yakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebesa endlini yakhe, wabeka ukudla phambi kwabo, wathokoza kanye lendlu yakhe yonke ngokukholwa kuNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi sekusile, induna zathumela amanxusa zisithi: Khululani labobantu bahambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umlindintolongo wabikela uPawuli lawomazwi esithi: Induna zithumele ukuba likhululwe. Ngakhoke phumani, lihambe ngokuthula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uPawuli wathi kubo: Basitshayile obala singalahlwanga licala, thina singamaRoma, basiphosela entolongweni; khathesi sebefuna ukusikhulula ngensitha na? Atshi, kabeze bona, basikhuphe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amanxusa azibikela izinduna lawomazwi. Zona zesaba sezisizwa ukuba bangamaRoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho zeza zabancenga; zabakhupha, zabacela ukuba baphume emzini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho basebephuma entolongweni, bangena koLidiya; kwathi sebebabonile abazalwane, bakhuluma amazwi okubaqinisa, basuka bahamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.16.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
